FAQ_OPEN=Frequently asked questions
CONTACT_WRITE=Questions, ideas or a problem? Write to us:
DATA=Your data
DATA_OFFLINE=Sketching works offline. Your pages stay on this device: Sketching sends them nowhere.
DATA_BACKUP_IOS=They are also part of this device’s iCloud Backup when it is on (Settings › your name › iCloud › iCloud Backup): restoring the device, or setting up a new one, from that backup brings them back.
DATA_BACKUP_ANDROID=They are also part of this device’s Google backup when it is on (Settings › Google › Backup): a new or reset device that restores from it gets them back.
DATA_BACKUP_DESKTOP=They are kept in Sketching’s folder on this computer.
DATA_HOW=To keep a copy of your own, or to move to another device: Export puts everything in one file, to keep where you like (a cloud drive, the device, a message); Import, on any device, puts it back — replacing what is there.
DATA_EXPORT=Export
DATA_IMPORT=Import
DATA_EXPORT_READY=Your backup is ready ({0} files): choose where to keep it.
DATA_EXPORT_SAVED=Saved ({0} files): {1}
DATA_EXPORT_FAILED=The backup could not be made.
DATA_NOT_BACKUP=That file is not a Sketching backup, or it is damaged.
DATA_CANT_OPEN=The file could not be opened.
DATA_CONFIRM=Replace everything in Sketching on this device with this backup from {0} ({1,plural, one{# page} other{# pages}})? What is here now will be gone: export it first if you want to keep it.
DATA_REPLACE=Replace
DATA_IMPORTED=Imported: everything is as it was on {0}.
DATA_IMPORT_FAILED=The backup could not be imported: nothing was changed.
LICENCES=Licences
LICENCE_FONTS=Fonts
LICENCE_LIBRARIES=Libraries
LICENCE_MISSING=This licence is missing from the app.
